{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jusfit-hammer-drill-2604-0032","content_id":"e1b0fbc2-0a96-4640-89df-1b64a818301e","description":"Product Safety Report for Jusfit Hammer Drill presenting a serious risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"32fd7de0-8b3f-4b71-908c-3300d3a0b64f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-06T13:07:36+01:00","id":"32fd7de0-8b3f-4b71-908c-3300d3a0b64f","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-08-06T13:07:36+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a747908f23cedd3e136622a/2604-0032-product-safety-report-JUSFIT-hammer-drill.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Jusfit Hammer Drill</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of fire as the plug was fitted with a fuse link which does not conform to the requirements of BS 1362 and lacks any granular filler.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery - Hammer Drill and Impact Driver Kit (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Justfit</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>ZDH-26</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Plug model</td>\n      <td>LP-60L</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product carton identifiers</td>\n      <td>RVG15096-251127-0001-158</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A black and yellow lithium battery powered hammer drill supplied with charger and wall plug.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_32fd7de0-8b3f-4b71-908c-3300d3a0b64f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a747908f23cedd3e136622a/2604-0032-product-safety-report-JUSFIT-hammer-drill.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of fire as the plug was fitted with a fuse link which does not conform to the requirements of BS 1362 and lacks any granular filler. The filler is required to ensure the safe operation of the fuse under fault conditions, and its absence could lead to the plug overheating and/or exploding. Additionally, the mains plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363 and may not make a secure connection with the socket. Improvements to documentation and markings are required.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0032</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-24T09:54:12Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-04-24","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-04-24T10:54:12+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jusfit-hammer-drill-2604-0032","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jusfit-hammer-drill-2604-0032","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jusfit-hammer-drill-2604-0032","content_id":"e1b0fbc2-0a96-4640-89df-1b64a818301e","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-04-24T09:54:12Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Jusfit Hammer Drill (2604-0032)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jusfit-hammer-drill-2604-0032","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk level","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Adaptors, Plugs and Sockets","value":"adaptors-plugs-sockets"},{"label":"Chemica